msgid "About fully refreshing screens"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Showing a new content on an E-ink screen usually does not fully clear the "
"previous content and leaves some blur. It may be referred as E-ink shadow or "
"ghosting.\n"
"The blur needs a full refresh to be cleared cleanly. But a full refresh can "
"be slow and trigger a flicker.\n"
"KOReader allows users deciding the frequence of the full refresh, i.e. more "
"full refreshes for better display quality or less full refreshes for "
"responsiveness.\n"
"Usually you do not to adjust this configuration, the balanced setting should "
"be good enough for most of the use cases."
msgstr ""

msgid "Never automatically fully refresh screen"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The full refresh will happen only when showing an image, moving to next "
"chapter or opening another book."
msgstr ""

msgid "Low full refresh rate for better responsiveness"
msgstr ""

msgid "Balance between responsiveness and quality"
msgstr ""

msgid "High full refresh rate for better display quality"
msgstr ""

msgid "Color rendering"
msgstr "Отрисовка в цвете"

msgid "Disable double tap"
msgstr "Отключить двойное касание"

